   "stem": {
      "text": "A particle moves along the curve \\( x^{2} + y^{2} = 25 \\) so that its coordinates \\( x \\) and \\( y \\) are differentiable functions of time \\( t \\). At the instant the particle is at the point \\( (3, 4) \\), the \\( x \\)-coordinate of the particle is decreasing at a rate of 2 units per second. Find \\( \\frac{dy}{dt} \\), in units per second, at that instant."
   },
